# npm pack uses this file instead of .gitignore, so the package JavaScript
# `build/` is included. Do not ignore:
#   build/
#   ios/AukiSDK.xcframework/
#   ios/AukiSDK/
#   android/src/main/jniLibs/
#   android/src/main/java/uniffi/
# Gradle and Xcode output is excluded by android/.npmignore and ios/.npmignore.
# A pattern here cannot drop those directories while `android` and `ios` are
# listed in package.json `files`.
node_modules/
example/
*.tgz
.DS_Store
*.log
